* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 5
* <Natural Source Header
* RMPRBU - Print Active Bundle
* Bundle Contents is printed as follows:
* - ALL
*   The bundle is printed as one uint.
*   (VTAM, SYSPRINT (POWER), TAPE, DISK, CON-NECT, NAF)
* - PORTION
*   The Program is advised to print only a portion of the Bundle.
*   Bundle Start Separator and Bundle VTOC are printed within the
*   first Portion, Bundle End Separator within the last.
*
* Maintenance
* uuu yy-mm-dd s(999999) ...
* mrs 93-02-25 s(999999) created
* mrs 93-11-02 s(999999) old version saved, various modifications
* mrs 93-12-14 s(999999) don't print separators of archived reports
* mrs 94-01-05 s(161550) terminate with condition code
* mrs 94-02-24 s(999999) terminate only if type ne subtask
* mrs 94-03-10 s(999999) logon to / logoff from esy
* gw  94-03-23 s(999999) assign flush-desc
* mrs 94-05-20 s(999999) follow printout until canceled or printed
* gw  94-05-30 p(129055) phone separator variable
* gw  95-01-09 p(135759) wake monitor when finished
* gw  95-02-09 p(136952) previous separator taken if no separ. defined
* gw  95-02-21 p(137438) make date and time vaiables in bundle separator
* mrs 95-05-10 s(224641) jobname substitution variable corrected BS2
* mrs 95-05-18 s(225071) descr substitution variable corrected
* gw  96-10-18 s(999999) printout statistics exit
* gw  96-10-24 s(238382) stop printing if VSE error 681 job active
* jvd 97-10-09 p(163166) Replace Callnat 'OUTDATE' with 'IODATE-N'
*                        Y2C and use only one date routine for NOM
* gw  98-03-24 s(279421) sort reports by repname-rnb within group-seqno
*                        new superde BC-BUNDLE-RNB-GROUP-SEQNO-REPRNB
*                        if not present (NAT3061) we use the old one
* gw  98-07-16 p(172297) recat for build list active bundle redesign
*                        to include prerequisites
* jvd 98-09-14 p(164220) NAT23ÖNOM141
* sju 99-05-06 p(182497) avoid parm truncation by doing 2 inputs
* sju 99-06-17 p(183296) new bundle substitution variables
* sju 99-06-28 p(183721) new printer exit return code 97 (means don't
*                        call again until next report separator)
* sju 99-07-14 p(184320) set FLUSH-REPNAME for printer exits
* jvd 99-11-10 p(188713) Steplib for non NAT.SEC environment
*                        and remove comments pre 1997
* sju 00-04-28 p(191368)  wake up print task
* xsisgg 00-05-31 p(191312) sort reports in bundle - take out old code
* xsiszha 2000-08-15 (CE7461) Extend Report and Bundle Names
* sju 00-11-21 s(999999) Check setting of lfile 131 (SAT log file)
* sju 01-04-20 p(208757) User-exit to decide old or new sequence
